    <div class="split__main">
      <div class="sechead">
        <span class="sec">in the room</span>
        <h2 class="h2--small">Facilitation and consulting</h2>
      </div>
      {% set quote = "The future depends on how well we collaborate." %}
      {% set from = "what-in-the-world-is-world-class-engineering-part-3" %}
      {% set fromTitle = "What in the World Is World-Class Engineering? Part 3" %}
      {% include "epigraph.njk" %}
      <p>I bring engineers and subject-matter experts into one room to work through a real problem together. With Denver Water, I built the Storm Kit, a tool that improved their water quality prediction. In 2026 I ran a Design Storm and a workshop at Explore DDD on deciding where domain boundaries belong after an EventStorm.</p>
      <p class="muted">Domain-modeling sprints, working sessions and team offsites, hourly, by the project or by the block of time. Whatever gets you the result you came for.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn--line" href="/consulting/">See consulting packages</a></p>
      <ul class="ledger">
        <li><span class="mono muted">2026</span><span>From EventStorm to Boundaries · workshop, Explore DDD</span></li>
        <li><span class="mono muted">2026</span><span>Design Storm · Explore DDD</span></li>
        <li><span class="mono muted">Denver Water</span><span>Storm Kit · water quality prediction</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="split__side">
